# Margin Notes, by Muse Ember and SZ. A calm lo-fi study beat: a nylon guitar motif over
# felt grand-piano chords in Eb major at 74 BPM, a muted trumpet answering in the B sections,
# a rimshot Dusty-kit backbeat and a low string bass. Built by its own script,
# tools/arranger/margin-notes.mjs, started from tools/arranger/lib.mjs.
# Lineup: guitar (lead, nylon-guitar), piano (chords, grand-piano), trumpet (counter,
# soft-lead, B sections only), pad (tape-pad, root and fifth, B sections only), bass
# (bass, string-bass), drums (dusty-kit). Motif: G4/4 Bb4/8 C5/8 Bb4/2, developed
# stepwise through phrase A and answered by the trumpet in B. Form: 1-4 intro (piano
# alone), 5-12 A1 (guitar over piano), 13-20 A2 (rim kit and bass enter), 21-36 B
# (through IV and the borrowed iv Abm, pad and trumpet in), 37-52 breakdown (kit and
# bass out, piano and guitar trade phrases), 53-68 A again (piano voicing up),
# 69-84 B again, 85-100 A once more (half-note bass at the end), 101-108 outro
# (guitar and piano), 109-112 piano alone ending on Eb so the loop returns to bar 1.
# chords: Ebmaj7 Cm7 Abmaj7 Bb7
# chords @5: Ebmaj7 Cm7 Abmaj7 Bb7 Ebmaj7 Cm7 Fm7 Bb7
# chords @13: Ebmaj7 Cm7 Abmaj7 Bb7 Ebmaj7 Cm7 Fm7 Bb7
# chords @21: Ebmaj7 Ab Abm Ebmaj7 Fm7 Bb7 Ebmaj7 Bb7
# chords @29: Ebmaj7 Ab Abm Ebmaj7 Cm7 Abm Bb7 Ebmaj7
# chords @37: Ebmaj7 Cm7 Abmaj7 Bb7 Ebmaj7 Cm7 Fm7 Bb7
# chords @45: Ebmaj7 Cm7 Abmaj7 Bb7 Ebmaj7 Cm7 Fm7 Bb7
# chords @53: Ebmaj7 Cm7 Abmaj7 Bb7 Ebmaj7 Cm7 Fm7 Bb7
# chords @61: Ebmaj7 Cm7 Abmaj7 Bb7 Ebmaj7 Cm7 Fm7 Bb7
# chords @69: Ebmaj7 Ab Abm Ebmaj7 Fm7 Bb7 Ebmaj7 Bb7
# chords @77: Ebmaj7 Ab Abm Ebmaj7 Cm7 Abm Bb7 Ebmaj7
# chords @85: Ebmaj7 Cm7 Abmaj7 Bb7 Ebmaj7 Cm7 Fm7 Bb7
# chords @93: Ebmaj7 Cm7 Abmaj7 Bb7 Ebmaj7 Cm7 Fm7 Bb7
# chords @101: Ebmaj7 Cm7 Abmaj7 Bb7 Ebmaj7 Cm7 Fm7 Bb7
# chords @109: Ebmaj7 Cm7 Abmaj7 Ebmaj7
# 1-4: Intro: piano alone over the crackle
# 5-12: A1: guitar over piano, no kit and no bass
# 13-20: A2: the rim kit and the bass enter
# 21-28: B1: through IV and the borrowed iv, the trumpet answers
# 29-36: B2: the Abm turn again, the trumpet answers lower
# 37-44: Breakdown 1: kit and bass out, guitar leads the trade
# 45-52: Breakdown 2: piano leads the trade, the guitar answers in fragments
# 53-60: A3 first half: kit and bass back, piano voicing up
# 61-68: A3 second half: ghost hats join the rim groove
# 69-76: B3 first half: pad and trumpet back
# 77-84: B3 second half: the borrowed iv turn, trumpet lower
# 85-92: A4 first half: the motif once more, sequenced up at the turn
# 93-100: A4 second half: half-note bass, sparser kit
# 101-108: Outro: guitar and piano only, thinning
# 109-112: Outro ends as the intro began: piano alone, back to Eb
title: Margin Notes
composer: Muse Ember & SZ
year: 2026
source: original
category: originals
key: Eb major
style: lofi
tempo: 74
time: 4/4
about: A calm lo-fi study beat for a long stretch: a nylon guitar motif over felt piano chords, a muted trumpet answering in the middle, and a dusty rimshot backbeat that barely builds at all.

